WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.626 --> 00:00:30.459
(Lee Joon, Meteor Vocational High School 1st Year, bad at fighting)
Although it might be hard to believe,

2
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.836
(Lee Joon, Meteor Vocational High School 1st Year, bad at fighting)
I am not good at fighting.

3
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.526
But why am I so bad at fighting?

4
00:00:38.906 --> 00:00:40.113
Is it because my body is too weak?

5
00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:49.723
Red hair... damn it.

6
00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:53.989
Then,

7
00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.330
is it because I don't try hard enough?

8
00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.889
Just when I was about to despair over my fighting skills

9
00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:12.273
that hadn't improved at all,

10
00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:14.819
I found a new method.

11
00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.219
- Damn it, I really want to get stronger. - Hey.

12
00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.219
If you want to get stronger that badly,

13
00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:20.869
why not go to Meteor Vocational High School?

14
00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:25.996
Why not go to Meteor Vocational High School, and with Ancheon's strongest thugs...

15
00:01:30.907 --> 00:01:32.742
(Welcome to Meteor Vocational High School!)

16
00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:43.954
(Meteor Senior Vocational High School)

17
00:01:52.896 --> 00:01:54.130
(Rank 180)

18
00:01:54.131 --> 00:01:55.564
(Rises to Rank 173)

19
00:01:55.565 --> 00:01:56.866
(Rises to Rank 139)

20
00:01:56.867 --> 00:01:58.801
(Rises to Rank 76)

21
00:01:58.802 --> 00:02:01.203
(Rises to Rank 17)

22
00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:14.009
(Rank 17)

23
00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:15.879
(Rank 17)
No matter how hard I tried,

24
00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.379
(Rank 17)
I couldn't rise above rank 17.

25
00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.149
(Rank 17)

26
00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:21.923
(Rank 17)
But it's too early to give up now.

27
00:02:29.566 --> 00:02:30.167
(Study Group Club Member Application Form)

28
00:02:30.168 --> 00:02:31.835
(Future Activity Plan: Conquer Meteor Vocational High School)

29
00:02:33.593 --> 00:02:35.689
Because for me, there is still something I haven't tried yet,

30
00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.533
my last resort.

31
00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:45.481
(3rd Period: English - Singular Form)

32
00:02:45.482 --> 00:02:46.516
(National Language. 3rd Period: English - Singular Form. Math.)

33
00:02:53.356 --> 00:02:55.491
(Those who want to study, gather around!)

34
00:02:55.492 --> 00:02:57.661
(Hwang Min-hyun)

35
00:02:58.094 --> 00:02:59.962
(Han Ji-eun)

36
00:02:59.963 --> 00:03:01.264
(Cha Woo-min)

37
00:03:11.174 --> 00:03:12.608
(Lee Jong-hyun)

38
00:03:12.609 --> 00:03:13.843
(Shin Soo-hyun)

39
00:03:14.778 --> 00:03:17.180
(Yoon Sang-jeong, Gong Do-yu)

40
00:03:22.652 --> 00:03:27.324
"Study Group"

41
00:03:33.176 --> 00:03:35.679
- Hey, Yoon Jiamin. - What do you mean by 'Conquer Meteor Vocational High School'?

42
00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.489
You actually mean conquering it by fighting?

43
00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.259
- Hey. - It would be weird to interpret that as studying, right?

44
00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:41.439
Exactly.

45
00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.859
Looks like you're really good at studying.

46
00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.153
- Hey. - So jealous.

47
00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.389
Yoon Jiamin, listen to me first.

48
00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:51.329
I'm sorry, I started the study group because I want to study.

49
00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:54.139
I didn't start it to help with your fighting rank.

50
00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.159
Hey, this is also learning.

51
00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.883
Learning martial arts.

52
00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.279
Ah, then just fight me.

53
00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:02.070
If you don't want to do that either,

54
00:04:02.071 --> 00:04:04.770
just tell me how you usually train.

55
00:04:12.713 --> 00:04:14.180
Otherwise, I'll also join the study...

56
00:04:18.153 --> 00:04:19.376
Do you really want to join?

57
00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:22.149
I'm asking if you really want to study.

58
00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:22.993
Yeah.

59
00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.600
I do.

60
00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:25.880
Of course I do.

61
00:04:32.323 --> 00:04:34.329
We are going to visit Teacher Han-kyung.

62
00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.833
Finish writing all of this before we get back.

63
00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:37.923
Is it a test?

64
00:04:38.706 --> 00:04:39.503
Yes.

65
00:04:53.476 --> 00:04:55.180
Wait a minute, I've almost solved everything.

66
00:05:33.917 --> 00:05:36.453
(Yoon Jiamin Basic Math)

67
00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.769
Are you Yoon Jiamin?

68
00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.570
What?

69
00:05:40.673 --> 00:05:42.193
Come with me. This is a test.

70
00:05:43.093 --> 00:05:44.633
What? A... a test?

71
00:05:46.329 --> 00:05:48.356
Isn't Yoon Jiamin the number one ranker in the first year?

72
00:06:00.276 --> 00:06:01.113
Yes.

73
00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:03.423
I am Yoon Jiamin.

74
00:06:04.114 --> 00:06:07.283
(A springboard to future dreams, a proud Meteor student)

75
00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:13.630
Damn it.

76
00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.529
Long time no see, Detective.

77
00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.533
Indeed.

78
00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:35.130
Because this is the first time we've met since that incident last year.

79
00:06:40.933 --> 00:06:41.923
However,

80
00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:45.043
Why of all places are you at Meteor Vocational High School?

81
00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.080
Hey.

82
00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.430
Stop hitting him.

83
00:07:19.066 --> 00:07:20.960
Hey, I said stop hitting him.

84
00:07:22.886 --> 00:07:23.850
Are you okay?

85
00:07:30.333 --> 00:07:31.443
Anti.

86
00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.749
Why am I so weak?

87
00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.059
What are you talking about?

88
00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.329
You are not weak.

89
00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:38.936
You just haven't gotten strong yet.

90
00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:42.049
I believe one day you will become super strong.

91
00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.506
And it will be your turn to protect me.

92
00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.956
I'll be counting on you then, Lee Joon.

93
00:07:52.763 --> 00:07:54.400
I passed the test.

94
00:07:55.546 --> 00:07:57.259
I'm a member of the Yeonbaek Gang now.

95
00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:59.040
So don't come looking for me anymore.

96
00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.180
Get out of the car.

97
00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:28.080
I'm Oh Jang-ho, in charge of scouting new talent for the YB Family.

98
00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:30.269
This gathering is to select the reserve forces for the 'Yeonbaek Gang'.

99
00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:32.029
In other words, the standing army test.

100
00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:34.749
Only the top three rankers from each school are qualified to take the test.

101
00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:35.700
You only get one chance.

102
00:09:35.701 --> 00:09:37.155
Man, my lines are so smooth.

103
00:09:37.156 --> 00:09:38.710
After all, I say them every day.

104
00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.493
Listen up, the way to pass is simple.

105
00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:43.890
See that car over there?

106
00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:47.206
Just grab the car key on the hood of that car.

107
00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:50.429
Not only will you become a member of the 'Yeonbaek Gang' standing army,

108
00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:52.360
that car will also be yours.

109
00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.410
How about it?

110
00:09:57.726 --> 00:09:59.669
The method is simple,

111
00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.500
but it's not as easy as it sounds.

112
00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:05.123
It's not some f***ing child's play, right?

113
00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.473
There will be people stopping you from getting the key.

114
00:10:09.456 --> 00:10:12.733
Namely, your seniors who passed the standing army test not long ago.

115
00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.465
(Jang Bi-hwan (17) Yeonbaek Gang Standing Army / Major Criminal Record: Robbery)

116
00:10:16.032 --> 00:10:17.634
(Seo Yoo-bi (18) Yeonbaek Gang Standing Army / Major Criminal Record: Attempted Murder)

117
00:10:18.034 --> 00:10:19.469
(Gook Gwan-woo (17) Yeonbaek Gang Standing Army / Major Criminal Record: Aggravated Assault)

118
00:10:20.326 --> 00:10:21.563
There are no rules.

119
00:10:22.163 --> 00:10:25.706
By any means necessary, get the car key.

120
00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.090
That way, you'll take your first step towards a successful life.

121
00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.210
Are you ready?

122
00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.703
Do you guys actually believe that bullshit?

123
00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:46.260
Begin.

124
00:10:48.143 --> 00:10:48.943
F***.

125
00:10:48.944 --> 00:10:51.010
Get 'em, you little punks.

126
00:10:52.886 --> 00:10:54.823
This kid 100% ran away.

127
00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:59.049
- Where did he run off to? - What's going on?

128
00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.890
See? I told you he wouldn't be here.

129
00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.809
But his eyes didn't say that.

130
00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.599
What do eyes say?

131
00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.939
Hair dyed as red as gochujang.

132
00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:09.470
Looked like a delinquent right off the bat.

133
00:11:10.796 --> 00:11:12.099
What should we do?

134
00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.019
I already told Teacher Han-kyung that we gathered all 5 people.

135
00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:15.923
I'm so hungry.

136
00:11:15.924 --> 00:11:17.249
Let's just go eat first.

137
00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.362
(Smart Soup)
I even bought Smart Soup!

138
00:11:22.506 --> 00:11:23.590
What should we do?

139
00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.243
The students at Meteor Vocational High School have good quality.

140
00:11:33.626 --> 00:11:36.009
Well, they don't call it a 'School for Gifted Delinquents'

141
00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:38.023
for nothing.

142
00:11:38.693 --> 00:11:41.943
But f***, you strawberry head.

143
00:11:42.673 --> 00:11:44.193
Rank number one, Yoon Jiamin.

144
00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:48.333
I heard you're the strongest monster in the history of Meteor Vocational High School.

145
00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.110
Were they all just rumors?

146
00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:57.273
But let me ask you,

147
00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.583
are you really Yoon Jiamin?

148
00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:09.203
I don't know where you got the nerve to pull something like this,

149
00:12:09.823 --> 00:12:11.649
but no matter who you are,

150
00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:13.993
the result for the Yeonbaek Gang standing army test...

151
00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:15.913
You fail.

152
00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.606
But this doesn't just end here.

153
00:12:24.333 --> 00:12:26.980
You wasted my time, so you have to pay the price.

154
00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:29.533
That's how the world works.

155
00:13:01.097 --> 00:13:02.865
(W Cram School Math 1 Mock Exam)

156
00:13:03.273 --> 00:13:04.283
Lee Joon.

157
00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.366
Study group test result...

158
00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.071
You pass.

159
00:13:12.163 --> 00:13:14.119
They are students from Meteor Vocational High School!

160
00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.729
You idiots are quite loyal to each other.

161
00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.380
The idiot is you, the mister playing the gangster.

162
00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:21.583
Aren't you embarrassed living like this at your age?

163
00:13:22.033 --> 00:13:23.793
You kids got some nerve.

164
00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.149
Worst case, we can just go complain to the police.

165
00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:29.650
Is that why you're so arrogant?

166
00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.333
Joon, come here.

167
00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:38.833
So you are Yoon Jiamin.

168
00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:42.190
You guys are still young, so you don't really understand.

169
00:13:43.363 --> 00:13:45.036
Although the law isn't right in front of you,

170
00:13:48.183 --> 00:13:49.840
the pain is very real.

171
00:13:50.716 --> 00:13:51.470
Stop it.

172
00:13:51.471 --> 00:13:53.140
Yeonbaek Gang standing army test...

173
00:13:53.683 --> 00:13:54.684
do you want to try again?

174
00:13:55.183 --> 00:13:57.806
Come over and take this, and you'll pass the test.

175
00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:07.719
By the way,

176
00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:10.829
Pi Han-wool went straight home as soon as he arrived at the police station that day.

177
00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:14.550
He even knew my name, despite me having just been transferred here recently.

178
00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.719
Don't you think that's a bit strange?

179
00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:19.433
Well, what's so strange about it?

180
00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:23.660
Are we sure this police station is actually doing its job?

181
00:14:28.351 --> 00:14:29.543
Don't make a fuss.

182
00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.060
He's just a high school student.

183
00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.733
- Is that so? - Yeah.

184
00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:38.343
Don't worry too much about it, just get off work.

185
00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.359
Right.

186
00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:56.300
That's the attitude a student coming to the police station should have.

187
00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.219
But what should we...

188
00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:03.233
say when we go in?

189
00:15:06.886 --> 00:15:07.953
I don't know.

190
00:15:10.603 --> 00:15:11.919
Let's just go in first.

191
00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:13.553
We'll figure something out.

192
00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:16.899
But Se-hyun, aren't you scared?

193
00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:18.983
Of course I am.

194
00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:22.736
I came here precisely because I was too scared to go with them.

195
00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:27.966
But at least the police station isn't as scary as a gangster's den, right?

196
00:15:30.446 --> 00:15:31.100
(Dunchun Police Station)

197
00:15:31.101 --> 00:15:33.449
- Let's go in. - Yeah.

198
00:15:39.916 --> 00:15:41.463
Are you really okay?

199
00:15:42.213 --> 00:15:45.179
Psycho four-eyes, just worry about your glasses.

200
00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:46.766
Your mom will be worried.

201
00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:02.556
Damn it.

202
00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:20.256
I don't know what gives you the right to be so arrogant,

203
00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:21.703
but in the end,

204
00:16:22.923 --> 00:16:24.956
the one holding the knife is the strongest, right?

205
00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.150
F***ing bastard. Damn it.

206
00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.366
Knowledge is mightier than the sword.

207
00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:13.613
Bitch.

208
00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.906
This is the first time I've seen someone
block the psycho four-eyes' punch!

209
00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:42.196
Rank number one, Yoon Jiamin.

210
00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.023
Seems like the rumors are true.

211
00:17:51.373 --> 00:17:54.010
Unbelievable, I'm actually fighting high school brats here.

212
00:17:54.686 --> 00:17:56.580
Do you think I'm a pushover?

213
00:18:16.106 --> 00:18:16.950
What's going on?

214
00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:18.956
Did you take the hit on purpose?

215
00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:20.986
He must have been hit really hard.

216
00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:24.329
Don't step on him.

217
00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.549
Are you telling me to take my foot off him?

218
00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:28.660
This is f***ing ridiculous.

219
00:18:30.663 --> 00:18:33.429
Hey, this little clique of yours is pretty cool.

220
00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:35.103
It's not a clique.

221
00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:37.586
We are a study group.

222
00:19:26.273 --> 00:19:28.803
F***, I should quit smoking.

223
00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:31.290
Hey, high school brats.

224
00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.413
However,

225
00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:38.209
that guy even impersonated you to take the standing army test.

226
00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.263
He doesn't even know how to fight.

227
00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:44.556
It's obvious this guy is going to be a stumbling block in your life.

228
00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.973
Why are you protecting him so much?

229
00:19:52.843 --> 00:19:53.703
Oh boy.

230
00:20:00.206 --> 00:20:01.989
(Hanlim Gymnasium)
Starting next time, you are forbidden from using this technique.

231
00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:03.679
How can you do that?

232
00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:07.560
By the way, your damn kicks were exceptionally fierce today.
Did something happen?

233
00:20:21.237 --> 00:20:22.204
(Sewoon Middle School Aptitude Test)

234
00:20:23.826 --> 00:20:25.029
8 points?

235
00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.029
Why is it that no matter how hard I study,

236
00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.696
my score never goes up?

237
00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:37.069
(Hanlim Gymnasium)
If only I had that.

238
00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:40.109
- A reference book? - No, something better than a reference book.

239
00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:41.202
What is it?

240
00:20:41.203 --> 00:20:42.869
Something that makes people work harder,

241
00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:48.619
and passionately give it their all to change themselves.

242
00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.698
So I'm asking you what that is.

243
00:20:50.699 --> 00:20:52.529
(W Cram School Math 1 Mock Exam)

244
00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:53.783
24 points.

245
00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:55.743
Not bad, right?

246
00:20:58.506 --> 00:21:00.409
He's an opponent not to be underestimated.

247
00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:01.799
What's important is,

248
00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.680
he didn't guess, he actually solved all of them.

249
00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:06.636
Yeah, I finally found it.

250
00:21:14.293 --> 00:21:16.073
Joon is not a stumbling block.

251
00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:25.850
He might even be considered my rival.

252
00:21:28.776 --> 00:21:30.839
Joon, don't get me wrong.

253
00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:33.450
I've never considered you a rival.

254
00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.983
I can use that move on the mister, right?

255
00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:42.103
What?

256
00:21:42.104 --> 00:21:43.509
Uncle said it's very dangerous.

257
00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:45.999
He told me to absolutely never use this technique.

258
00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:47.179
Little brat.

259
00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:49.633
- Don't do anything dangerous. - No.

260
00:21:50.073 --> 00:21:51.463
Not me, but you.

261
00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:56.432
(Uncle's Forbidden Technique)

262
00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:07.650
(Move 1: One-Sided Beating)

263
00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:53.099
