265
00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:56.110
Hey.

266
00:23:14.843 --> 00:23:16.199
Are you sick?

267
00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:18.019
Isn't that an empty car?

268
00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:19.713
Almost hit someone.

269
00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.346
No, he really intended to run us over.

270
00:23:25.846 --> 00:23:26.826
Correct.

271
00:23:27.530 --> 00:23:28.893
Hey, Yoon Jiamin.

272
00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:31.716
Do you have any intention of trying to live with us?

273
00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:36.763
With your skills,
managing the standing army should be a perfect fit.

274
00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:38.449
Managing the standing army?

275
00:23:38.450 --> 00:23:42.019
How can an idiot graduating from Meteor Vocational High School support himself?

276
00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.530
- Isn't that right? - No.

277
00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:49.000
Wow, so loyal.

278
00:23:52.026 --> 00:23:53.579
We are going to college.

279
00:23:53.580 --> 00:23:55.830
What? College?

280
00:23:57.206 --> 00:24:00.150
Hey, are you really crazy?

281
00:24:00.683 --> 00:24:03.513
Damn it, I already like you.

282
00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:09.026
Oh.

283
