326
00:26:31.450 --> 00:26:34.719
Hey, contact me immediately if anything happens, alright?

327
00:26:34.720 --> 00:26:36.983
Even if I'm taking a dump, I'll rush over without hesitation.

328
00:26:47.100 --> 00:26:49.329
At least that mister isn't scumbag.

329
00:26:49.330 --> 00:26:50.613
Right, psycho four-eyes?

330
00:26:57.343 --> 00:26:58.530
