335
00:27:08.290 --> 00:27:09.303
And so?

336
00:27:10.860 --> 00:27:13.223
I'm sorry, Mom. I won't be late again.

337
00:27:13.733 --> 00:27:16.866
You remember you only went to Meteor Vocational High School
after making a promise to me, right?

338
00:27:17.686 --> 00:27:19.089
Of course I remember.

339
00:27:19.090 --> 00:27:21.013
Oh, really?

340
00:27:21.803 --> 00:27:24.216
This is really the last time, I swear.

341
00:27:26.316 --> 00:27:28.649
Fortunately, the matter was handled smoothly.

342
00:27:28.650 --> 00:27:30.779
Thanks to the study group kids,

343
00:27:30.780 --> 00:27:32.690
