351
00:27:50.430 --> 00:27:52.089
I'll be counting on you.

352
00:27:52.090 --> 00:27:54.203
Okay, I'll be counting on you even more.

353
00:27:54.643 --> 00:27:55.866
Take good care of your health.

354
00:27:56.380 --> 00:27:57.993
It will be very dangerous from now on.

355
00:28:05.033 --> 00:28:06.101
(Pi Han-wool)

356
00:28:08.340 --> 00:28:08.970
Even the talent scout got beaten up by that kid Yoon Jiamin.

357
00:28:08.971 --> 00:28:11.103
(Ancheon Meteor Senior Vocational High School, Lee Han-kyung)
Even the talent scout got beaten up by that kid Yoon Jiamin.

358
00:28:11.606 --> 00:28:13.579
