460
00:33:38.856 --> 00:33:43.899
Our study group has finally been recognized as an official club.

461
00:33:43.900 --> 00:33:46.643
So we'll have a club office very soon.

462
00:33:47.440 --> 00:33:48.769
A study group club office?

463
00:33:48.770 --> 00:33:49.636
Yes.

464
00:33:51.476 --> 00:33:54.600
