Nice to meet you.

523
00:36:56.260 --> 00:36:58.236
- Hello, Teacher. - Hello, Teacher.

524
00:36:59.303 --> 00:37:01.540
Senior, what's our schedule for today?

525
00:37:03.123 --> 00:37:04.899
As expected of God Teacher Lee Han-kyung.

526
00:37:04.900 --> 00:37:05.813
Senior.

527
00:37:06.210 --> 00:37:07.709
He's very handsome.

528
00:37:07.710 --> 00:37:09.459
Could Teacher Lee Han-kyung be...

529
00:37:09.460 --> 00:37:10.300
flirting with him?

530
00:37:10.301 --> 00:37:11.939
Then they must be that, right?

531
00:37:11.940 --> 00:37:13.853
Campus couple.

532
00:37:14.206 --> 00:37:15.650
Kids, it's not what you think.

533
00:37:16.070 --> 00:37:17.110
Hurry up and go inside.

534
00:37:17.660 --> 00:37:18.609
And send a message to Jiamin,

535
00:37:18.610 --> 00:37:20.859
tell him to come straight to Manil High School.

536
00:37:20.860 --> 00:37:21.843
- Okay. - Okay. - Okay.

537
00:37:23.763 --> 00:37:25.156
Hurry and follow along.

538
00:37:28.996 --> 00:37:29.953
Most of our students at Manil High School

539
00:37:29.954 --> 00:37:33.049
have joined one or more study groups.

540
00:37:33.050 --> 00:37:34.369
To allow students to explore and learn independently,

541
00:37:34.370 --> 00:37:36.253
the school provides support.

542
00:37:36.760 --> 00:37:38.119
Moreover, Manil High School

543
00:37:38.120 --> 00:37:39.609
along with Hwamun High School, Chwehwa Girls' High School,

544
00:37:39.610 --> 00:37:41.179
and Kangshi University Affiliated High School,

545
00:37:41.180 --> 00:37:43.273
are all top-tier prestigious schools.

546
00:37:44.573 --> 00:37:46.749
Then you must be able to send 4 or 5 students
to the top 3 universities, right?

547
00:37:46.750 --> 00:37:48.203
About 200 students every year.

548
00:37:48.900 --> 00:37:50.053
200 students?

549
00:37:52.100 --> 00:37:53.299
Pretty impressive.

550
00:37:53.300 --> 00:37:54.853
Truly remarkable.

551
00:38:07.953 --> 00:38:09.833
These are the study group members here.

552
00:38:10.393 --> 00:38:12.336
She is the study group leader, Hong Jae-hee.

553
00:38:14.976 --> 00:38:17.676
These are the Meteor Vocational High School students I mentioned.

554
00:38:22.036 --> 00:38:24.259
Hey, you heard that too, right?

555
00:38:24.260 --> 00:38:25.570
I think I heard it too.

556
00:38:26.023 --> 00:38:28.989
'Where did these idiot airheads come from?'
I wasn't the only one who heard that, right?

557
00:38:28.990 --> 00:38:30.469
What are you talking about?

558
00:38:30.470 --> 00:38:31.859
She didn't say anything that harsh.

559
00:38:31.860 --> 00:38:34.086
Right, she didn't say 'airheads'.

560
00:38:34.566 --> 00:38:35.580
Students.

561
00:38:35.956 --> 00:38:37.983
Are all the members here?

562
00:38:38.426 --> 00:38:39.819
Yoo Jun-min hasn't arrived yet.

563
00:38:39.820 --> 00:38:40.803
I see.

564
00:38:41.166 --> 00:38:42.809
Jun-min has been late a lot lately.

565
00:38:42.810 --> 00:38:43.649
It's okay.

566
00:38:43.650 --> 00:38:44.999
We also have one person who hasn't arrived yet.

567
00:38:45.000 --> 00:38:47.739
I see. Then, to get to know each other better first,

568
00:38:47.740 --> 00:38:49.700
let's just chat briefly.

569
00:38:56.480 --> 00:38:57.263
Here...

570
00:38:57.643 --> 00:38:59.489
The study group space is really nice.

571
00:38:59.490 --> 00:39:00.879
So jealous.

572
00:39:00.880 --> 00:39:01.613
Right?

573
00:39:02.450 --> 00:39:05.630
But we'll have our own space soon too.

574
00:39:06.070 --> 00:39:09.849
Look, they all use tablets to take notes.

575
00:39:09.850 --> 00:39:13.223
Even their pencil cases have combination locks.

576
00:39:14.710 --> 00:39:17.989
Even their ballpoint pens are special.

577
00:39:17.990 --> 00:39:20.289
That's a disappearing ink pen.

578
00:39:20.290 --> 00:39:23.479
If you use it to solve problems, the ink disappears the next day.

579
00:39:23.480 --> 00:39:24.110
Really?

580
00:39:24.110 --> 00:39:24.766
Yeah.

581
00:39:26.030 --> 00:39:28.056
Yoon Jiamin would pass out if he saw that.

582
00:39:34.756 --> 00:39:36.963
Hey, you heard that too, right?

583
00:39:38.993 --> 00:39:40.106
Of course I heard it.

584
00:39:41.070 --> 00:39:44.260
He called us bugs and told us to let them study in peace.

585
00:39:45.486 --> 00:39:47.219
But why isn't Jiamin here yet?

586
00:39:47.220 --> 00:39:48.440
Are you sure you sent him a message?

587
00:39:49.013 --> 00:39:50.573
I sent it to the group chat!

588
00:39:57.044 --> 00:39:58.178
(Hee-won: Jiamin, you should be able to find the way yourself, right?)
(Jiamin: Sorry! I'll be there soon!!!)
(Ji-woo: Hey, come straight to Manil High School in Yeongdeungpo.)

589
00:39:58.179 --> 00:39:59.347
(Manyik-il High School)

590
00:40:00.163 --> 00:40:03.693
Hey, it would be hilarious if he actually went to Manyik High School.

591
00:40:05.486 --> 00:40:06.350
Hey.

592
00:40:06.351 --> 00:40:08.155
How could there be a school like that?

593
00:40:08.156 --> 00:40:10.691
(Manyik High School)

594
00:40:14.128 --> 00:40:15.897
(Manil High School)

595
00:40:18.666 --> 00:40:20.767
(Ji-woo: Hey, come straight to Manil High School in Yeongdeungpo.)

596
00:40:20.768 --> 00:40:22.370
(Manyik-il High School)

597
00:40:27.833 --> 00:40:30.060
A school with a rich history and tradition...

598
00:40:31.246 --> 00:40:32.536
This must be the place.

599
00:40:34.715 --> 00:40:52.799
(Manyik High School)

600
00:40:52.800 --> 00:40:56.871
"Study Group"

